    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can offer personalized explanations. They can adapt to different learning styles, giving step-by-step help for different problems. They can also provide practice problems and instantly grade them. This could make learning feel less intimidating and more interactive, especially for students with different paces and interests."
